      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is 闫清, same face, short black hair, small old scar above the outer end of his left eyebrow, dark T-shirt and gray trousers as the preceding shots. He occupies frame left in close profile, eyes fixed on the phone; his expression begins serious, pauses in surprise, then he alone slowly smiles.\n<Subject 2> is the butcher. He remains off-camera except for one right forearm and right hand entering from frame right. Keep the dark navy short sleeve and the small old knife scar in the web of his right hand. His arm holds the phone steady; do not show any part of his face.\n<Subject 3> is the same single matte-black smartphone, upright in the butcher's right hand near Yan Qing's face. Its screen shows a small truck carrying calm live pigs entering a plain receiving gate. Keep the phone body and screen image stable; screen footage is the only moving insert.\n<Subject 4> is the same pre-dawn pork stall. Keep the same dark wooden door, white tile, warm red-lamp glow, sausage string, counter and the same pork tray partially at the lower edge.\n<Picture 1> fixes the crop, composition, camera position, screen direction and lighting. The shot scale is final; do not widen.\n\nsummary:\nOne static close shot contains Yan Qing's face, the butcher's scarred hand holding the phone, and the phone screen together. The butcher sincerely explains that the meat is fresh. Yan Qing watches the truck footage, pauses, then slowly smiles. There is no cutaway to the actual slaughterhouse and no shot of the butcher's face.\n\nretention_analysis:\nYan Qing remains the same recognizable person on frame left. The butcher remains represented only by the same right hand and navy sleeve entering from frame right. The same phone stays upright between them, and the same pork tray and stall remain in place. Only the tiny truck footage and Yan Qing's facial expression change. No camera move, cut, zoom or axis crossing.\n\ndetailed_description:\nPhotorealistic live-action drama, matching the preceding video and Picture 1: natural skin and fabric texture, restrained market color, practical warm red stall lights. No animation, cartoon, game render or product-advertisement style.\n\n[Shot 1] Static eye-level 85mm close composition from the same side of the 180-degree axis. Yan Qing's recognizable face fills the left third; the phone is large and sharp at center-right with its screen facing camera; the butcher's scarred hand and navy forearm enter from the right edge. Do not show the butcher's face. The phone is close to Yan Qing but does not touch him. Keep the pork tray just visible along the lower edge.\n\nKeep the exact crop and background alignment of Picture 1. Preserve the visible part of the stall: same wooden door, same tiled wall, same warm red light, same hanging sausage and partial counter. Do not widen to reveal additional lamps or background. The slaughterhouse exists only inside the phone screen and must never fill the main frame.\n\nOne uninterrupted action for 12.25 seconds:\n0.0-4.0s The butcher's hand holds the phone perfectly steady while he speaks off-camera. The truck footage is already playing on the screen; the truck with live pigs begins to roll toward the gate. Yan Qing watches with a serious, attentive expression.\n4.0-6.5s The truck passes through the receiving gate inside the phone screen and moves a short distance into the yard. The pigs remain calm and visible in the truck. The phone, hand, stall and camera stay still.\n6.5-8.0s Yan Qing pauses to take in the footage; his eyes open slightly and his mouth holds still. No smile yet.\n8.0-10.5s Only Yan Qing's mouth corners rise slowly into a restrained smile while he keeps looking at the screen. The butcher's face stays offscreen; his hand remains steady.\n10.5-12.25s Yan Qing's small smile settles and holds. The truck is stopped just inside the gate on the tiny phone screen. End on the same composition, without any new movement.\n\n<Subject 1> (S1) says, <d>[Chinese] 老板，你这猪肉是早上现杀的吗？</d> <Subject 2> (S2) says, <d>[Chinese] 你放心，绝对新鲜，</d> <Subject 2> (S3) says, <d>[Chinese] 刚从屠宰场拉回来，不信你看看。</d> Off-screen voice-over (S4), <d>[Chinese] 嘿，是挺新鲜。</d>\n\nNo subtitles, readable text, logos, app UI or watermarks. No pig squeals or animal distress. No non-diegetic music.",
